{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>And he called it Novach</b> — לה three times in the Masorah do not pronounce the heh: ויקרא לה נובח (and he called it Novach) — in its name that did not endure for it, this name. ויאמר אלי לבנות לה בית בארץ שנער — he sought to build but did not build. ויאמר לה בועז — he did not speak with her himself but by means of an agent — לה like לא:"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:36.590614459Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}